Provides: ${diverted-files}
Conflicts: ${diverted-files}
Description: Lugh sign-in screen
 The graphical login of Lugh OS: a Qt 6 / QML greeter that greetd runs inside
 the cage kiosk compositor. Debian's /etc/greetd/config.toml is diverted, not
 overwritten. If the greeter fails three times in a row, the text greeter
 tuigreet is started instead, so a login is always possible.
